@--[4]. The reason there are such indefinite things of all things in the Spiritual World, and also in the natural world, is that they come forth from the Infinite... Unless they came forth thence they would never be indefinite: therefore also from the indefinite things in both worlds, it is manifestly evident that the Divine is infinite.

