@6004[3]. (The exercises of charity relating to giving instruction.) Signified.

@6078[5]. In these places, "pasture" = the truths in which man is instructed... For the spiritual life is such that if it is deficient of this "pasture," it languishes.

@6443[end]. They cannot come into clearness before they have been in Heaven, and have been instructed concerning truths by the Angels...

@6471. A certain Spirit... from those who... have instructed many others... that all good and truth are from the Lord...

