@6695[2]. I have spoken... with the Spirits and Angels who had been inhabitants of those Earths... with open instruction from the Heaven whence they were.

@6776. "They came and drew" = that they were instructed in truths from the Word.

@6778. To "give to drink the flock of their father" = that they might thence be instructed in good.

