@10406. He (then) confirms it from the sense of the letter... which he falsifies by a wrong application, and a perverted interpretation...

@10652[2]. Profanation takes place when evil is applied to truth, and truth to evil, which is done by a wrong interpretation of the truth...

@AR 736. That this interpretation is in the natural sense... Signified.

@--[end]. Therefore interpretations are given elsewhere also in the natural sense, which however cannot be interiorly understood except by means of the spiritual sense...

@CL 44[10]. (We looked up into Heaven) because thence we have all interpretations of the Word.

@SE 1137. (The internal Spirits of this province) interpret all things well, even if they are not good...

