@TCR 796. Luther... by turns permitted questions...

@AE 721[22]. "Ask and see" (Jeremiah 30:6).

@1089[end]. He who loves truth because it is truth, can as it were interrogate the Lord in doubtful things of faith, and receive answers from Him; but no where else than in the Word...

