@--[end]. The art by which they made themselves invisible was disclosed; it was a peculiar art...

@AE 426[4]. The Lord causes those who are... good to turn themselves to Him; and when they thus turn themselves away from the evil they become invisible to them; for this is general in the Spiritual World, that when anyone turns himself away from another he becomes invisible.

@LJPost 23[end]. The Dutch traders... at once become invisible, which is from the fact that in the world they had been unwilling to publish their business to others.

